cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hydra in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Hydra (hyctl): the trust control plane for AI development"
abstract: >-
  Hydra (hyctl) is a local-first, multi-vendor AI control plane. It routes
  each task to a model by confidence of correctness, not just price: the
  cheapest model on your machine or account that clears the confidence you
  set. One command, every model.
authors:
